# orphan-branch-lint.waivers — branches on origin that carry work not in main
# and knowingly have no pull request (#2029).
#
# Format: <branch> <whitespace> <reason>.  `#` starts a comment; blank lines
# are ignored.  A waiver with no reason is refused.
#
# Both directions fail (tools/orphan-branch-lint.sh):
#   an ahead-of-main branch older than 24h with no PR and no waiver -> FAIL
#   a waiver naming no ahead-of-main branch on origin any more      -> FAIL
#
# A waiver is a decision someone made about a branch, not a way to make the
# scheduled run go green. Prefer opening a PR (even a closed one records the
# work) or deleting the branch.
